INVENTORY MANAGEMENT QA POC █
FINAL PROJECT [JAVA / VAADIN / SPRING BOOT]

~~~

AUTHORS: MANUEL RODRIGUEZ + CRISTIAN DE LA HOZ
PURPOSE: QUALITY-ASSURED INVENTORY MANAGEMENT
STATUS: IN DEVELOPMENT

~~~

ABOUT:

Inventory Management QA POC is our final project: an inventory platform for
managing products, categories, suppliers, users, and stock movements.

It combines a Vaadin workspace, REST APIs, Keycloak security, PostgreSQL
persistence, automated tests, and correlated operational telemetry.

~~~

FOCUS:
 - Inventory catalog and stock ledger
 - Role-based access control
 - Vaadin and REST workflows
 - Automated testing and observability
